ram/Course, and (b) your educational or Student/Applicant records are maintained by the Educational Partner, including for purposes of assigning credit or certification, and not Campusdnuia.</p>
					
					<h2 data-aos="fade-up">Services Offering by Campusdnuia & its Process</h2>
					<p data-aos="fade-up">Campusdnuia offers following services through its technology platform.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><h2 data-aos="fade-up">1. Instant Study Loan -(No Cost EMI)- </h2></p><p data-aos="fade-up"> Campusdnuia offers technology platform to assist the applicants/Parents/User in getting Instant Study Loan upto 4, 00,000 from Loan Issuing Authority/NBFC to students/Applicants with minimum documentation–(Aadhar card and pan card of Parent/user) and facilitates the loan fee disbursement to Educational institution or applicant after deduction of processing fee i.e. upto 15% of loan amount. Student/Parent/User/Applicants will pay back the EMI’s to loan issuing Partner/NBFC without any interest in Easy EMI’s in next 9 months.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><strong>Step to avail:-</strong><br>Student/Parent need to register on Campusdnuia register form https://www.Campusdnuia.co.in/login with his/her Mail Id, Mobile number, other details like Aadhar card and pan card. Parent/Student /User who don’t have pan card or negative Cibil score will not be able to use the loan services through the Campusdnuia Platform. Student/Parent/User needs to select the institution and to select the course for which they want to pay fee or to opt services of Campusdnuia for Instant Study Loan & Accommodation Loan. If Student /Parent User Select the Apply Loan then we will redirect it to our associated Loan Issuing Authority/NBFC. Student/Parent/User need to sign up to provide the details like Email Id, Mobile number, Aadhar Card Number, Pan Card to avail the Loan/Credit Limit. Loan Issuing Authority/NBFC will seek the access permission of their bank statement verification for the approval. Once user will do they will approve the loan/credit limit within 4 hours and maximum 24 hours. Then Student/Parent need to come back on the Course fee page of Campusdnuia and Select the fee amount payment through Apply Loan and click the payment option . On Successful Payment Campusdnuia will send the notification to Student/Parent/User on registered mail id on Campusdnuia for the payment details made . Same they can see into their User Dashboard of Campusdnuia in the Payment History.Settlement of loan fee will be done by Loan Disbursing authority within next 48 hours.Loan disbursing authority will settle the Loan Settlement Amount into Institution Account after deducting the Loan Processing Fee.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><strong>Example: -</strong><br>If Student/Parent/ User make the Course fee payment of 1, 00,000 then settlement into institution or into applicant account will be 85,000 after deducting the Loan Processing Fee (15% of Loan Amount). Student/Parent/User need to pay back this loan amount of Rs 1,00,000 in easy EMI’s in next 9 months without any interest.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><strong>Instant Study Loan -(Standard EMI)- </strong>Campusdnuia offers technology platform to assist the applicants/Parents/User in getting Instant Study Loan upto 4, 00,000 from Loan Issuing Authority/NBFC to students/Applicants with minimum documentation–(Aadhar card and pan card of Parent/user) and facilitates the loan fee disbursement to Educational institution or applicant after deduction of processing fee i.e. upto 5% of loan amount + standard rate of interest up to 18%.Student/Parent/User/Applicants will pay back the EMI’s to loan issuing Partner/NBFC with interest in Easy EMI’s.</p>
					
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><h2 data-aos="fade-up">2.Secure Study Membership –</h2></p><p data-aos="fade-up">Campusdnuia through its technology platform offers Secure Study Membership to Students who take admission into its associated Institutions. Secure membership starts from INR 999 to INR 1,999 Yearly . Secure Study membership help students to get their study continue in case of any financial crisis or any mishap in the family with earning member. Student will also get the health coverage * during the hospitalization of above 24 hours and can avail once in a year of subscription. Student/Parent will also get discounts on making online fee payment or any other payment on Campusdnuia Platform like accommodation booking, food, travel & lifestyle.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><strong> Note: - </strong>(Insurance Plans. Premium, claim settlements and Subscription is subject to the term & conditions set up by Campusdnuia and insurance company).</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><strong>Step to avail:-</strong>Student/User can avail the Subscription by simply applying it online on Campusdnuia during admission or after admission. It is available for both existing and New Students into Campusdnuia associated Institute.</p>
					
					<p data-aos="fade-up"><h2 data-aos="fade-up">3. Online Admission, Fee Collection, course Selling & Cashback Offers-</h2></p><p data-aos="fade-up">CampusDunia through its technology platform offers services to educational institution or platform for domestic and international Online Admission, Fee Collection , Course selling & Cash back to its User/students – User who wants take admission online in Educational Institution for Offline and Online Class , need pay the service charge for it to CampusDunia which will be upto 10 % or Rs 500 + GST (wherever is higher) for Admission Form fee or Course fee or Application fee . CampusDunia also provide Fee Collection services through its Platform where User can opt the payment option of Course fee or Admission form fee or Application fee by Self or EMI option forEducational Institution/platform.</p>
					<p data-aos="fade-up">In Case of Self payment source , user will redirect to payment gateway which will further settle the fee into Institution account on the behalf of student/user in agreed time line ( max in 4 working days for domestic & max in 15 days for international admission fee or application fee or course fee payment) While for EMI option CampusDunia redirect the User/Applicant/ Student to its partner NBFC or associated platform for the Fee Finance and fee Settle done into Educational institution / Platform bank account or User/Applicant/ Student bank account.</p>

					<p data-aos="fade-up">Student/User/Applicants can avail the cash back while taking the admission/ Course fee / Application fee online through CampusDunia technology Platform into its Associated Educational Institution/ platforms. Cash back is subject to available option provided by Educational Institution / platform or from the Payment gateways.</p>
					
					<h2 data-aos="fade-up">Steps to note: -</h2>
